# N4 slice 1, staged (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts): the code of call: code data is found where the call stands,
# before any body is checked, only through the name of a named Structure. v holds a copy of S, so S's procedure was
# not prepared to run over explicit data: refused at the code operand.
S:
    int: x
    x: x + 1
end: S
D:
    int: x 4
end: D
S: v
call: v D
return
